{"title":"2009 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems\">2009 AMC 10B #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems\">2009 AMC 12B #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(proportionality)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (proportionality)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Paula the painter had just enough paint for 30 identically sized rooms.  Unfortunately, on the way to work, three cans of paint fell off her truck, so she had only enough paint for 25 rooms.  How many cans of paint did she use for the 25 rooms?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e7735cc42acc4acddd9cec2714514e49a742faa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 10\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 15\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 18\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Losing three cans of paint corresponds to being able to paint five fewer rooms. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557e45944d0b815327839dbde2fc9a87ce8d4d4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 35 \\cdot 25 = \\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28proportionality.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(proportionality)\">Solution 2 (proportionality)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (proportionality)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is the number of cans,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55ad2b16a7c731ee003cf7ca94226d0986db9dd7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{p}{30} = \\frac{p-3}{25} \\implies \\frac{p}{p-3} = \\frac{6}{5} \\implies 5p = 6p-18 \\implies p=18\\]\" width=\"471\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c7279871833cbbe77104d517158558f04369354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-3 = \\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B\">2009 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems/Prob